1
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:06,464
I heard you guys
fighting last night.

2
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:07,549
You did?

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:09,551
I'm staying right
next to your room.

4
00:00:09,759 --> 00:00:10,260
Oh.

5
00:00:10,552 --> 00:00:11,552
Sorry.

6
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:13,013
Why did you fight like that?

7
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:14,848
No we didn't.

8
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:17,058
Kim Taehun acted way too
sensitive all by himself.

9
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,114
I told him to
participate in group training

10
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,687
and he acted stubborn again.

11
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:24,774
Why did he even shout?

12
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:27,861
I touched his shoulder.

13
00:00:28,945 --> 00:00:29,945
Touched his shoulder?

14
00:00:30,113 --> 00:00:31,531
I mean, he kept ignoring me

15
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:33,354
so I just tried to talk
some sense to him.

16
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:35,577
Oh, never mind.

17
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:37,245
He was all riled up.

18
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:40,290
Hey, it could be...

19
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:43,126
Because he is possessed.

20
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:45,919
What?

21
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:47,255
The hell are you saying?

22
00:00:47,422 --> 00:00:48,422
Quiet.

23
00:00:48,465 --> 00:00:50,008
Be quiet.

24
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:51,342
Why?

25
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:52,718
My friend

26
00:00:52,927 --> 00:00:54,929
went to same school
as Taehun's.

27
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:56,013
The thing is

28
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:57,432
that his mother is a shaman.

29
00:00:58,808 --> 00:00:59,434
So he hates

30
00:00:59,434 --> 00:01:02,145
someone touching him, because
ghosts may haunt him.

31
00:01:05,565 --> 00:01:06,733
Damn.

32
00:01:06,733 --> 00:01:08,276
I'm afraid of ghosts...

33
00:01:08,276 --> 00:01:09,903
Why did he say
such useless stuff?

34
00:01:12,572 --> 00:01:13,990
I don't think there's a ghost.

35
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,043
What?

36
00:01:25,043 --> 00:01:26,043
Why did he wake up?
